{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%arg fps · %@ Mbit/s · encoding %@ ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$arg fps · %2$@ Mbit/s · encoding %3$@ ms"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$arg 帧/秒 · %2$@ Mbit/s · 编码 %3$@ ms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Install Tailscale on this Mac and sign in.\n2. Install it on the device you'll connect from and sign in with the same account.\n3. Come back here: ClawTank shows the name to use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 在此 Mac 上安装 Tailscale 并登录。\n2. 在连接所用的设备上安装 Tailscale，并使用同一账户登录。\n3. 返回此处：ClawTank 会显示要使用的名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Install Windows App from the App Store.\n2. Tap + → Add PC. PC name: %arg. User account: %arg and your ClawTank password.\n3. Tap the PC to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "1. Install Windows App from the App Store.\n2. Tap + → Add PC. PC name: %1$arg. User account: %2$arg and your ClawTank password.\n3. Tap the PC to connect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 从 App Store 安装 Windows App。\n2. 点按 + →“添加电脑”。电脑名称：%1$arg。用户帐户：%2$arg，密码使用 ClawTank 密码。\n3. 点按该电脑以连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Install Windows App from the Mac App Store.\n2. Click + → Add PC. PC name: %arg. User account: add %arg and your ClawTank password.\n3. Double-click the PC. Tip: in the PC's settings, turn on \"Optimize for Retina displays\" for crisp text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "1. Install Windows App from the Mac App Store.\n2. Click + → Add PC. PC name: %1$arg. User account: add %2$arg and your ClawTank password.\n3. Double-click the PC. Tip: in the PC's settings, turn on \"Optimize for Retina displays\" for crisp text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 从 Mac App Store 安装 Windows App。\n2. 点按 + →“添加电脑”。电脑名称：%1$arg。用户帐户：添加 %2$arg，并使用 ClawTank 密码。\n3. 连按该电脑。提示：在电脑设置中开启“针对 Retina 显示器进行优化”，以获得清晰文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Open Remote Desktop Connection (press Win+R, type mstsc, Enter).\n2. Computer: %arg. Click Show Options; User name: %arg.\n3. Connect, enter your ClawTank password, and accept the certificate after checking its fingerprint matches the one shown in ClawTank.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "1. Open Remote Desktop Connection (press Win+R, type mstsc, Enter).\n2. Computer: %1$arg. Click Show Options; User name: %2$arg.\n3. Connect, enter your ClawTank password, and accept the certificate after checking its fingerprint matches the one shown in ClawTank."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 打开“远程桌面连接”（按 Win+R，输入 mstsc，然后按 Enter）。\n2. 电脑：%1$arg。点按“显示选项”；用户名：%2$arg。\n3. 连接并输入 ClawTank 密码；确认指纹与 ClawTank 显示的一致后，再接受证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 fps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 帧/秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "60 fps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "60 帧/秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent %arg is in control. Stop button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理 %1$arg 正在控制。停止按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent action": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent name, e.g. Claude Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理名称，例如 Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent refused": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理请求被拒绝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent “%arg” is in control": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理“%1$arg”正在控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent “%arg” is in control: %arg": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Agent “%1$arg” is in control: %2$arg"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理“%1$arg”正在控制：%2$arg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents on this Mac can take screenshots, move the mouse, type and open apps through a local API\n(127.0.0.1 only, never the network). Each agent needs its own token. Every action is written to the\nconnection log, a badge shows while an agent is in control, and a person using the Mac over RDP\nalways takes priority.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 上的 Agent 可通过本地 API 截屏、移动鼠标、输入文字和打开 App（仅限 127.0.0.1，不通过网络）。每个 Agent 都需要独立令牌。每项操作都会写入连接日志；Agent 控制期间会显示标记；通过 RDP 使用 Mac 的用户始终拥有优先权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow AI agents to control this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许 AI 代理控制此 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Accessibility": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许辅助功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Screen Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许屏幕录制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow connections from outside your network?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许来自网络外部的连接？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowlist (optional): IPs or CIDRs, comma-separated": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许列表（可选）：IP 或 CIDR，用逗号分隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anyone who can reach this Mac's port could try to log in. Only do this behind a VPN, with a strong password, and ideally with an allowlist. Failed logins are rate-limited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何能访问此 Mac 端口的人都可能尝试登录。请仅在 VPN 后、使用强密码并最好配置允许列表时启用。失败登录会受到速率限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies from the next connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次连接时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply Network Changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用网络更改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applying restarts the server and disconnects anyone connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用后会重启服务器并断开所有已连接的客户端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve ClawTank in System Settings → General → Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“系统设置”→“通用”→“登录项”中批准 ClawTank。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Application Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Authentication failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "认证失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic (virtual when headless)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动（无头时使用虚拟显示器）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Balanced": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "均衡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocked %arg": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已阻止 %1$arg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocked %arg: locked out after failed logins": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已阻止 %1$arg：登录失败次数过多，已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocked %arg: not on the allowlist": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已阻止 %1$arg：不在允许列表中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blocked %arg: not on your local network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已阻止 %1$arg：不在本地网络中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certificate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "证书"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes apply from the next connection or window resize.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次连接或调整窗口大小时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开系统设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a Password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ClawTank %arg · core %arg": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "ClawTank %1$arg · core %2$arg"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ClawTank %1$arg · 核心 %2$arg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ClawTank Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ClawTank 设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ClawTank lets you reach this Mac from any standard Remote Desktop client — Windows, Mac, iPad, iPhone or Linux — with a crisp, fast, full desktop. It works only on your local network unless you change that, and nothing goes through any cloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ClawTank 可让你通过 Windows、Mac、iPad、iPhone 或 Linux 上的标准远程桌面客户端访问这台 Mac，获得清晰、流畅的完整桌面。除非你更改设置，否则它仅在本地网络上工作，不经过任何云服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ClawTank needs to see the screen to send it to your remote client. Click the button, turn on ClawTank in the list, and come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ClawTank 需要查看屏幕，才能将画面发送到远程客户端。点按按钮，在列表中启用 ClawTank，然后返回此处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ClawTank only accepts connections from your local network and from Tailscale, a private encrypted\nnetwork between your own devices. Nothing is exposed to the internet, and you never need to\nforward a port on your router.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ClawTank 仅接受来自本地网络和 Tailscale 的连接。Tailscale 是你个人设备之间的加密专用网络。互联网无法访问此 Mac，你也无需在路由器上转发端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ClawTank: %arg": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ClawTank：%1$arg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ClawTank: agent %arg is in control": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ClawTank：代理 %1$arg 正在控制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
