          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use at least 8 characters, including uppercase, lowercase, and a special character.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请至少使用 8 个字符，并包含大写字母、小写字母和特殊字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is locked: remote clients see only the wallpaper until it's unlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 已锁定：解锁前，远程客户端只能看到墙纸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is on Tailscale. On the other device, install Tailscale, sign in to the same account, then use %arg as the PC name (same username and password). Nothing is opened to the internet: the connection travels inside Tailscale's encrypted network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 已连接到 Tailscale。在另一台设备上安装 Tailscale，登录同一帐户，然后使用 %1$arg 作为电脑名称（用户名和密码相同）。连接通过 Tailscale 加密网络传输，不会向互联网开放任何服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To connect from outside your home or office, install Tailscale (free for personal use) on this Mac and on the device you connect from, and sign in to the same account on both. Then use this Mac's Tailscale name as the PC name. See Settings → Remote Access. Don't forward port 3389 on your router.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若要从家中或办公室以外连接，请在此 Mac 和用于连接的设备上安装 Tailscale（个人使用免费），并在两台设备上登录同一帐户。然后使用此 Mac 的 Tailscale 名称作为电脑名称。请参阅“设置”→“远程访问”。不要在路由器上转发 3389 端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To reach this Mac while it sleeps, turn on System Settings → Energy (or Battery → Options) → Wake for\nnetwork access. On a headless Mac mini, also set it to start up after a power failure. ClawTank keeps\nthe Mac awake during a session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若要在此 Mac 睡眠时仍能访问，请开启“系统设置”→“能源”（或“电池”→“选项”）→“唤醒以供网络访问”。对于无头 Mac mini，还应设置为断电后自动启动。ClawTank 会在会话期间阻止 Mac 睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To type and click for you, ClawTank needs Accessibility. Turn on ClawTank in the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要代你输入和点击，ClawTank 需要“辅助功能”权限。请在列表中打开 ClawTank。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
