            "value": "Using FreeRDP 3:\nxfreerdp3 /v:%1$arg /u:%2$arg /dynamic-resolution /gfx:avc420\nOr add an RDP connection in Remmina with the same address and username."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 FreeRDP 3：\nxfreerdp3 /v:%1$arg /u:%2$arg /dynamic-resolution /gfx:avc420\n或者在 Remmina 中添加 RDP 连接，并使用相同地址和用户名。"
